malicious_snippets.code_snippet:
Use of uninitialized memory in Dawn (CVE-2024-6990). Example (conceptual):

T* ptr;
// ptr is not initialized
use(ptr); // uninitialized use

Out-of-bounds read in WebTransport (CVE-2024-7255). Example (conceptual):

char buffer[10];
read(buffer[15]); // out-of-bounds read
